### Gamepad controller subsystem

- `src\component\gamepad\controller\aim` contains `assist`, `calibration`, `curve`, `deadzone`, `filter`, `graph`, `integrator`, and `types` source/header pairs for aim processing.
- `src\component\gamepad\controller\calibration` contains `measure`, `normalize`, `profile`, `store`, and `validate` source/header pairs for controller calibration.
- `src\component\gamepad\controller\device` contains `capability`, `connection`, `discovery`, `id`, `identity`, and `registry` source/header pairs for device enumeration and identity.
- `src\component\gamepad\controller\driver` contains `decode`, `driver`, `dualsense`, `dualsense-edge`, `dualshock4`, `output-report`, `output`, `playstation`, `set`, and `xinput` implementations.
