## Integration Contracts

- `.agents-reverse-engineer\config.yaml` is the adjacent configuration input for the generation process.
- `.agents-reverse-engineer\GENERATION-PLAN.md` is both a queued Phase 1 input and the execution manifest.
- `AGENTS.md` is the generated directory-level artifact expected at every listed directory.
- `src\component\gamepad\controller` is the largest first-party subsystem represented in the plan.
- `deps\rapidjson`, `deps\zstd`, `deps\zlib`, `deps\libtomcrypt`, `deps\libtommath`, `deps\asmjit`, `deps\minhook`, and `deps\GSL` are vendored dependency trees included in documentation scope.
- `premake5.lua`, `generate.bat`, `generate-nightly.bat`, `generate-linux.sh`, and `fixdeps.sh` are build/generation entry points included as documentation targets.
- `README.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, CI files, issue templates, and build manifests appear in the queue because the plan documents workflow and repository conventions alongside source code.

